5,1,1,talk,Midori,,We should be careful about how we choose. I want to see why previous programs failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We need evidence of what actually helps patients before we commit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Staffing is always the bottleneck. I'll look into the current rosters.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic dictates we first verify the actual budget and how we earn back costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,And the physical space. We cannot ignore the parking and the booking system.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that's a fair point. We should divide the documents to cover all bases.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll focus on the trial data and the shared rounds to see the impact.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will check the nursing vacancies and the therapy review.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll take the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the rooms and the booking system records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll check the board minutes and the data agreements then.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
